      "value": "Turing replaces the ill-posed Can machines think? with the operational imitation game: a machine is deemed to think if an interrogator cannot reliably distinguish it from a human via conversation.",
      "language": "en"
     }
    ],
    "target": {
     "type": "SpecificResource",
     "source": "https://shir-openu.github.io/meta-tagging-showcase/papers/turing1950-machinery-intelligence.html",
     "selector": {
      "type": "TextQuoteSelector",
      "exact": "I shall replace the question by another, which is closely related to it and is expressed in relatively unambiguous words",
      "prefix": "al test (the imitation game) - \"",
      "suffix": "\" contradicts the original quest"
     }
    }
   },
