      "value": "Double/Debiased ML (DML) gives root-N consistent, valid inference on a low-dimensional (causal/treatment) parameter despite high-dimensional nuisance parameters estimated by ML — via Neyman-ORTHOGONAL scores (low sensitivity to nuisance error) and CROSS-FITTING (efficient sample splitting).",
