      "type": "TextualBody",
      "purpose": "describing",
      "value": "A style-based generator (borrowing from style-transfer) drives synthesis via a mapping network + AdaIN per layer, giving automatic unsupervised separation of high-level attributes (pose/identity) from stochastic detail (freckles/hair) and scale-specific control.",
