      "exact": "an au- tomatically learned, unsupervised separation of high-level attributes (e.g., pose and identity when trained on human faces) and stochastic variation in the generated images (e.g., freckles, hair), and it enables intuitive, scale-specific control of the synthesis",
      "prefix": " and scale-specific control. - \"",
      "suffix": "\" finding It improves state-of-t"
     }
    }
